  <p id="c-nanqishu-040-zixiang-xi-family:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">魚復侯<persName id="c-nanqishu-040-zixiang-xi-family:p001:m0003" ref="kix_r92_2ed_G">子響</persName>字<persName id="c-nanqishu-040-zixiang-xi-family:p001:m0006" ref="kix_r92_2ed_G">雲音</persName>，世祖第四子也。豫章王<persName id="c-nanqishu-040-zixiang-xi-family:p001:m0019" ref="ijh_3fs_6u2">嶷</persName>無子，養<persName id="c-nanqishu-040-zixiang-xi-family:p001:m0024" ref="kix_r92_2ed_G">子響</persName>，後有子，表留爲嫡。</p>
